  - m_Id: 22142452302340096
    m_Localized: Meters per death
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22154363693686784
    m_Localized: Salt
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22154378675740672
    m_Localized: Prevents the ghost from entering the salt area. Some ghosts may deactivate perk manually.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22154425832300544
    m_Localized: Crucifix
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22154457302163456
    m_Localized: Prevents the ghost attack.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22154494929264640
    m_Localized: Flashbang
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22154532678000640
    m_Localized: When used, enemy gets blinded and won't move.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22154566865772544
    m_Localized: No Blackout
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22154624453566464
    m_Localized: There's chance that you will no longer be affected by the blackout in School. This perk doesn't take space.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22154681273802752
    m_Localized: Medicaments
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22154724861009920
    m_Localized: Medicaments increase your ability to see items significantly further.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22154745622814720
    m_Localized: Lifesaver
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22154805643304960
    m_Localized: After having revived a teammate, you see items within bigger range.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22154836043620352
    m_Localized: Good Start
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22154889156091904
    m_Localized: Before your first teammate dies, you are more stealthy and cautious. Enemy chase radius is decreased and you see enemy's aura. Activates automatically when the match begins.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22154913957011456
    m_Localized: Care Taker
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22154949566652416
    m_Localized: Enemy chase radius is decreased for revived teammate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22154971372838912
    m_Localized: Caution
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22155067451760640
    m_Localized: Your caution allows you to see enemy's aura each time you pick up object for the first time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22155093037015040
    m_Localized: Sense
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22156070620225536
    m_Localized: 'After having turned off your flashlight, you see crawler''s aura. Cooldown: 30 seconds.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22156102782148608
    m_Localized: Leader
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22156129495670784
    m_Localized: You see items within bigger range when you're near your teammate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22156149309562880
    m_Localized: Note Taker
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22156197300789248
    m_Localized: Important objects that you walked by are marked on your map.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22156225696227328
    m_Localized: For Survivors
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22156297368494080
    m_Localized: 'When activated, enemy chase radius is increased by 100% for you, decreased <color=#17fc03>x%</color> for others. Effect duration: 1 minute.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22156430613143552
    m_Localized: Soul Guard
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22156488372903936
    m_Localized: After being revived, you see enemy's aura.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22156964065697792
    m_Localized: Wake Up
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22157011054485504
    m_Localized: When one of your teammate gets into dying state, you see items within longer range.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22157035318534144
    m_Localized: Death Revenge
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22157080449245184
    m_Localized: You start to see enemy's aura after one of your teammates gets killed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22157109339611136
    m_Localized: Left Behind
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22157160245878784
    m_Localized: When away by more than 7 meters from your teammates, there's a chance that the enemy won't chase you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22157187403997184
    m_Localized: Team Revenge
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22157233201602560
    m_Localized: When you are left alone, you are more stealthy. Enemy chase radius is decreased and you see enemy's aura.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22157273185902592
    m_Localized: Shock
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22157309797982208
    m_Localized: Once finding a dead body, you gain extra range in seeing enemy's aura.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22157337778184192
    m_Localized: Gotcha
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22157371856904192
    m_Localized: Grabbing found item gives you ability to see items within bigger range.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22157398012583936
    m_Localized: Sole Survivor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22157456598622208
    m_Localized: Each time one of your teammate dies, enemy's chase radius is decreased by <color=#17fc03>x%</color>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22157482217431040
    m_Localized: Sixth Sense
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22157534663008256
    m_Localized: When you complete task, you see enemy aura.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22157564610338816
    m_Localized: We'll make it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22157612257632256
    m_Localized: After one of the teammates got revived, you are filled with enthusiasm and you see items within bigger range.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22157649419165696
    m_Localized: Empathy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22157694633762816
    m_Localized: You see teammate aura who is in dying state.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22157726493696000
    m_Localized: Bond
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22157778867970048
    m_Localized: You are better off together. When near your teammates within 10 meters range, you see enemy's aura.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22157801001312256
    m_Localized: Insanity
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22157841627340800
    m_Localized: You randomly see enemy's aura for the duration of <color=#17fc03>x</color> seconds (every 1-3 minutes).
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22157870513512448
    m_Localized: Hope
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22157901601693696
    m_Localized: You have a strong hope. You randomly see items within bigger range for the duration of <color=#17fc03>x</color> seconds (every 1-3 minutes).
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22157926121594880
    m_Localized: Distortion
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22157971759816704
    m_Localized: Ghost doesn't feel you behind walls and won't chase you if you're in ghost's chase radius.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22157999828099072
    m_Localized: Eagle Eye
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22158040366047232
    m_Localized: You see one object from a great distance.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279797773596876800
    m_Localized: Traps removal speed increased. This perk doesn't take space.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279797793138139136
    m_Localized: You have a chance of avoiding bear trap, cooldown 10 sec. This perk doesn't take space.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279797822892531712
    m_Localized: While in chase, every player receives ability to see items within bigger range.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
