  - m_Id: 380155236128382976
    m_Localized: Force Waves
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 380155278671208448
    m_Localized: Ghost Wall
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 380155310187208704
    m_Localized: Telepathy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 380155339882881024
    m_Localized: Resurrection
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 380155393309925376
    m_Localized: Mind Control
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 387154197999857664
    m_Localized: Your flashlight won't turn off in school.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 387154237149491200
    m_Localized: When used you become invisible for enemy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 387154323124334592
    m_Localized: Black mold slows down enemies when they step into the mold. Some ghosts may deactivate perk manually.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 387154858715983872
    m_Localized: Items that your teammates walk by will be visible for you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 387154891754516480
    m_Localized: Revive all teammates on use.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 387154363553230848
    m_Localized: Drags enemies into a black hole.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 387154572261797888
    m_Localized: When in chase and enemy gets near, your movement speed is boosted and you see enemy aura.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 387154685390565376
    m_Localized: After being revived, you are granted <color=#17fc03>x</color> seconds of ghost immunity.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 387154803598635008
    m_Localized: You have pulsating waves that push enemies away. Unlimited duration.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 387154831050354688
    m_Localized: Spawns wall through which ghost won’t be able to pass. Some ghosts may deactivate perk manually.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410255897056849920
    m_Localized: Christmas Trap
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410255922163953664
    m_Localized: Lurks enemies towards the trap.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410256233104486400
    m_Localized: EMF Reader
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410256257041379328
    m_Localized: Detects enemy's presence when pointed within 50 meters range.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410710839915786240
    m_Localized: Healer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410710870286741504
    m_Localized: Heals every player within 5 meters in <color=green>x</color> seconds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 387154542528376832
    m_Localized: Cameras are setup around the map, they will notify you when enemy movement is detected. Use your device to check the location of enemy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 421602761337286656
    m_Localized: Grasp Master
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 421602761387618304
    m_Localized: Automatically picks up items around you, with increased range.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 466014805194432512
    m_Localized: Holy Book
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 466014829231988736
    m_Localized: 'Prevents death once. Range: 10 meters'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 387154658832232448
    m_Localized: You travel 10x faster as a "soul" and can find items. Effect is active for some duration or until you're attacked by ghost.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480197601389342720
    m_Localized: Premonition
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480197620532146176
    m_Localized: You're shown a player who will likely die during the next 5 minutes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480197673795612672
    m_Localized: Speed Boots
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480197696054784000
    m_Localized: Permanent movement speed boost. This perk doesn't take space.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480197835196624896
    m_Localized: Outline
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480197853701894144
    m_Localized: Important items are visible through walls. This perk doesn't take space.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480197895993061376
    m_Localized: One Rises
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480197912346652672
    m_Localized: You are instantly revived when you are in dying state and one of your teammates goes into dying state.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480197956508479488
    m_Localized: The Carry
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480197974531403776
    m_Localized: When carrying items, you see enemy aura in range.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480198018387046400
    m_Localized: Death Trap
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480198032249221120
    m_Localized: When you are in dying state, enemy speed is decreased.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480198071621152768
    m_Localized: Self Care
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480198084845793280
    m_Localized: You will be revived on first death. You also have a chance to stand up on next death.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480198179842584576
    m_Localized: Medic
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480198191662133248
    m_Localized: Your medical expertise lets you revive others without a medkit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480894370425331712
    m_Localized: Gift of Recovery
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 387154744228261888
    m_Localized: The ghost will get trapped in a cage when attack starts.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 387154714687778816
    m_Localized: Ghost ends the chase once it loses sight of you for some time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480894447495667712
    m_Localized: You have a gift of recovery - after being revived, your movement speed is increased by <color=green>%</color>, enemy speed is decreased by <color=yellow>%</color>. The perk is active for X seconds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 387154919256567808
    m_Localized: You control the ghost for the next few seconds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 514693282663755776
    m_Localized: Cursed Doll
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 515683144200089600
    m_Localized: Cursed doll moves very quickly and attracts enemies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 534924261118439424
    m_Localized: Ghost Path
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 534931523098636288
    m_Localized: Wildcard
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 538161340308779008
    m_Localized: Shows the enemy’s predicted movement as glowing footsteps on the ground.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 538161409179250688
    m_Localized: Replaces a random perk at start. After death, the perks of all survivors can be used again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 621616059259338752
    m_Localized: Adrenaline Shot
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 621616091551285248
    m_Localized: Once used, your speed is greatly increased for a limited time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 644086898430832640
    m_Localized: Crowbar
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 644086930890551296
    m_Localized: Allows you to pry open locked doors
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
